{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sf0434246ff98447b","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-fe6f6fd23f76af345e30","text":"怎么样？找到要拍的东西了吗？","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f49d5b9287336ea26cfc","text":"（展示照片）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6def38bcedb858e7f08f","text":"哎呀，照片里的虎克还是很可爱的嘛","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-73ad6a2ff56d3340d9b0","text":"我还记得这个俱乐部，咱还在这里打了场比赛呢！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-d2a78f5b7c0073247858","text":"等等，为什么我还拍过桑博啊！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-577756276c04ee62db9c","text":"我的技术进步了吧？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-75a41b33fc2cd7fdb980","text":"我的拍照技术是不是进步了很多？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6c652536401fa8a2b7a4","text":"别太得意了，想要拍出好照片，你还有很多东西要学呢！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-d3db25b725b24a4eb410","text":"但我也不会教你的，这样你就没法超过我咯","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-bee49077f165336449dc","text":"都是很有趣的照片","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-600ac7fdc6c7ff8e5b7b","text":"这些照片的内容都很有趣","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ba9f3701f60b44dcbac8","text":"当然了，那可都是我认真收集的！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-1e07fa703f3ad8ca25cc","text":"是我拍的桑博","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ba404869e943696b0b35","text":"是我特地拍的桑博","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6073a9897e6eacec15f3","text":"呃……","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-2df05351ca0d108e8e6e","text":"还是拍点好的吧！","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-67a791306193b2e03c26","text":"照片就快要收集完了，继续加油哦！","speaker":"三月七"}]}
